1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:03,200
Captain on the bridge!

2
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:05,000
Report, Chief.

3
00:00:05,200 --> 00:00:08,400
We picked up a distress call,
Captain. Twelve miles out.

4
00:00:08,600 --> 00:00:10,200
Can you play it back?

5
00:00:10,400 --> 00:00:13,900
...anyone... engine's flooded...
we can't hold...

6
00:00:14,100 --> 00:00:15,600
That's all we got, Captain.

7
00:00:15,800 --> 00:00:17,300
Set course. Full ahead.

8
00:00:17,500 --> 00:00:19,000
Steady as she goes, ma'am.

9
00:00:19,200 --> 00:00:22,100
Ensign Cole, I need you
on the forward deck.

10
00:00:22,300 --> 00:00:23,500
Aye, Captain.

11
00:00:23,700 --> 00:00:26,800
Morgan, keep hailing them
on channel sixteen.

12
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:28,300
Already on it.

13
00:00:28,500 --> 00:00:31,900
Oh, great. A storm front.
Just what we needed.

14
00:00:32,100 --> 00:00:35,400
If we cannot reach them
before that front closes in,

15
00:00:35,600 --> 00:00:38,700
every soul on that boat,
and I mean every soul,

16
00:00:38,900 --> 00:00:41,200
will be in the water by dawn.

17
00:00:41,400 --> 00:00:43,100
Then we reach them first.

18
00:00:43,300 --> 00:00:45,200
Danny, you okay? You look pale.

19
00:00:45,400 --> 00:00:48,100
I told you I'd be fine.
Worry about yourself.

20
00:00:48,300 --> 00:00:51,000
Chief, you were right
about the engine room.

21
00:00:51,200 --> 00:00:54,300
With respect, Captain,
I am always right about engines.

22
00:00:54,500 --> 00:00:57,200
Cole! Get down from there!
Are you out of your mind?

23
00:00:57,400 --> 00:00:59,000
The line was fouled, Chief!

24
00:00:59,200 --> 00:01:02,400
I do not care if it was on fire.
You will follow procedure.

25
00:01:02,600 --> 00:01:04,000
Understood, Chief.

26
00:01:04,200 --> 00:01:06,500
There! Off the port bow!

27
00:01:06,700 --> 00:01:08,200
I see them. Bring us about.

28
00:01:08,400 --> 00:01:10,100
Steady as she goes, ma'am.

29
00:01:10,300 --> 00:01:13,000
Nice work today, Danny.
Get some rest.

30
00:01:13,200 --> 00:01:14,800
You too, Captain.
